export anchor ClinicalStyle:
    number: 58
    screen: Inbox
    name: Clinical
    idea: A calm records system in pale blue-green, where every fact sits under a careful small-caps label and every alert is gentle, boxed and marked by a symbol.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #eef6f5, the background
        surface: #ffffff, panels and fields
        band: #f6fbfa, the quoted message and row hover
        text: #17302e, body text and field values
        label: #4a6563, field labels and meta text
        line: #c8dcd9, panel borders, with #e1ecea for inner lines
        teal: #0e6763, the primary button, selection, links and focus
        tealSoft: #d9eeeb, the selected row and active nav item
        info: #1d5a8c text on #e8f1f9, the Unread tag and the mention symbol
        ok: #1f6b3d text on #e6f3ea, the Done tag and the completed symbol
        notice: #7a5100 text on #fbf3df, gentle alerts, the review symbol and the unread count
    type:
        Segoe UI, system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Helvetica Neue, Arial,
        sans-serif. The page title is 24px semibold. The message is 17px on
        a 1.55 line height. Rows are 15px medium, bold when unread. Meta
        and times are 13px. Labels are 12px semibold uppercase with 0.05em
        tracking, and panel headings 13px semibold uppercase.
    layout:
        A white top bar with a teal outlined pulse mark, the brand, nav for
        Projects, Inbox and Reports, and Mara Okafor with Signed in at
        right. The page has the Inbox title with a short description and
        three bordered summary chips for items, unread and the reply
        requested by Monday. Below sit two panels, five to six. The left
        panel is titled Notifications with a segmented filter control and
        six rows, each with a 28px symbol disc, the sentence, status tags,
        a kind and project meta line and the time at right. The selected
        row has a teal left bar. The right panel shows the open mention
        with a four cell fact strip for From, Task, Project and Received, a
        gentle note with a clock symbol, the message as a quote with a teal
        left bar, three captioned thumbnails, a labelled reply field with
        a hint, and Reply, Mark as done and a quiet Open task link. Below
        960px the panels stack and the fact strip becomes two by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12 by 16px row and field padding, 24px between panels.
    density: Medium. Two lines per notification and a four cell fact strip for the open item.
    corners: 8px on panels, 6px on buttons, fields, alerts and thumbnails, 4px on status tags, round symbol discs.
    borders: 1px #c8dcd9 on panels with #e1ecea inside, a 4px teal left bar on the selected row and the quote.
    shadows: None. Structure comes from borders and labels.
    icons:
        16px line icons with a 1.8 stroke inside 28px tinted discs, an at
        sign for mentions, a tick for completed, an eye in a square for a
        review request and plain grey discs for the rest. Tags pair a dot
        with Unread, a tick with Done and an eye with Viewing.
    focus: A 2px teal outline offset 2px with a 5px soft teal ring. A focused field gets a teal border and the same ring.
    tone: Careful and factual, such as Received, Your reply and Note. Priya asks for a choice by Monday.
